{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 49\n【1 ModelRequest v1】CLI：cliworker models select --request-file <f>，或 --level Top --count 2 --usage Heavy --importance high --cwd <p> --request-id r-001；HTTP：POST /cliworker/select。{schema:'cliworker.request/v1', request_id:'r-001', level:'Top', count:2, usage:'Heavy', importance:'normal', require_readonly:true, cwd:'C:/work/repo', timeout_ms:1800000, exclude_handles:['h_1a2b']}。规则：level 必填，取 Top/High/Middle/Quick，大小写不敏感，缺失返回 E_LEVEL_REQUIRED，非法返回 E_LEVEL_UNKNOWN；count 取 1..10，默认 1；usage 取 Heavy/Normal/Light，默认 Normal；importance 取 normal/high，默认 normal，其他值返回 E_REQUEST_INVALID；未知字段给 W_FIELD_IGNORED:{field}；tier 是 level 的别名，给 W_FIELD_DEPRECATED。draft 视图：不带 schema 或带 compat:'draft' 时得到 draft 视图并带 W_DRAFT_DEPRECATED，0.3.0 移除；CLI 允许 draft，HTTP 上 draft 与 view:'full' 都需要有效会话，否则返回 403 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN；CLI 的 models select 带 view:'full' 返回 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN，完整视图只在 admin select。【2 ModelSelection v1（AgentLine 视图）】成功：{schema:'cliworker.selection/v1', ok:true, request_id:'r-001', level:'Top', usage:'Heavy', count_requested:2, count_returned:1, truncated:true, shortfall:1, models:[ModelHandle], calls:[Call], rejected:[{ref:'c3', reason:'quota_low'}], warnings:[{code:'W_STALE_DATA', ref:'c2'}], error:null, generated_at:'2026-11-07T10:00:00Z'}。失败：{schema:'cliworker.selection/v1', ok:false, request_id:'r-001', models:[], calls:[], truncated:false, shortfall:2, rejected:[], error:{code:'E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA', message:'...', retryable:true, retry_after:'2026-11-07T15:00:00Z'}}。至少一个候选通过了全部非额度过滤，且全部因 quota_low、reserve_protected 或 quota_unknown_policy 被拒时返回 E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA，否则返回 E_NO_CANDIDATE；retry_after 取被额度拒选的池中最早的 reset_at，没有则为 null。【3 ModelHandle v1】{schema:'cliworker.handle/v1', handle_id:'h_9f2c', lease_id:'l_7d1e', level:'Top', label:'Top-1', readonly:true, expires_at:'2026-11-07T12:00:00Z', call:{command:'<node 绝对路径>', args:['<pkg>/bin/cliworker.mjs','run','--lease','l_7d1e','--stat