n/frozen-files.json：{source_commit:'f75bb76', files:[{path:'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs', sha256:'...'}]}，path 只能位于该副本目录或为 test/characterization/stable.test.mjs。运行清单 files-executed.json：{mode:'full|filtered', filter:null, files:[...], platform, node}，只有 full 做集合相等。跳过记录：{schema:'cliworker.skip/v1', test, file, ac:'AC-027', requires:'win32|wsl|darwin|linux|pwsh|secret-tool|security', platform, node, reason, at}。smoke 报告：{schema:'cliworker.smoke/v1', mode:'real|dry-run', version, platform, node, steps:[{id:'wsl-discover', ac:['AC-038'], mandatory:true, status:'pass|fail|skip', reason, duration_ms}], redacted:true}；dry-run 步骤为 discover, wsl-discover（夹具）, enumerate, probe, select, run, http-select；real 模式在 win32 主机上 wsl-discover 为 mandatory。豁免 release/waivers.json：{waivers:[{ac:'AC-038', reason:'...', approved_by:'...', version:'0.2.0'}]}，只适用于 baseline 为 real-smoke 的 AC，单列为 waived，不算 pass。全流程步骤 test/flows/steps/<id>.mjs 导出 {id, introduced_by, run(env)}，必需集合为 auth, doctor, discover, enumerate, probe, select, run, http-select, http-admin。【16 上下文与时钟 contracts/context/context.v1.json】createContext(overrides) 返回 {exec, fs, fetch, env, platform, stdout, stderr, random, clock, now}；clock：{now():number, nowIso():string, setTimeout(fn, ms):handle, clearTimeout(handle), sleep(ms):Promise}；now 等于 clock.now。真实实现在 lib/context.mjs，设置了 CLIWORKER_TEST_CLOCK_FILE 时 now() 每次读该文件（毫秒数或 ISO）。测试伪时钟 test/helpers/clock.mjs 另提供 setNow(t)、advance(ms):Promise（按到期时间、相同时按注册顺序触发，回调间让出微任务）、pending():number；伪时钟下 sleep 只随 advance 前进。test/helpers/ctx.mjs 提供 fakeExec（记录 argv、env 名、调用次数）、fakeFs（访问探针）、fakeClock、fakeFetch。【17 仓库内权威规格与金标对应】contracts/registry.snapshot.json 对应 AC-009、AC-010、AC-059 的码与触发、AC-067 的 semantic_change；contracts/spec/surfaces.json 对应 AC-005；contracts/spec/migration-map.json 对应 AC-034、AC-067；contracts/golden/quota-shapes.json 对应 AC-015；contracts/golden/b44.json 对应 AC-016；contracts/golden/forecast/*.json 对应 AC-017；contracts/golden/capacity.json 对应 AC-050；contracts/golden/policy/*.json 对应 AC-051；docs/contract.md 由 scripts/gen-contract-doc.mjs 生成。npm 包包含 contracts/registry.snapshot.json、contracts/schemas、contracts/host、contracts/context、contracts/agentline-forbidden.json，不含 contracts/golden、contracts/spec 与 .collab。\r\nPython was not found; run without arguments to install from the Microsoft Store, or disable this shortcut from Settings > Apps > Advanced app settings > App execution aliases.","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_014tTvEhhFWjuhvwNT3RCY3i","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
